IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cbca-core`

-- Canada Business Corporations Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. C-44), section 2.1 -- INDIVIDUALS WITH
-- SIGNIFICANT CONTROL.
--
-- UNOFFICIAL. Encoded from a plain-text rendering of the Justice Canada consolidation current to
-- 2026-09-30, which is not an official version; nothing here is verified against the official text.
--
-- THE FACTS. A "significant number of shares" (s 2.1(3)) is measured against the corporation's whole:
-- the votes carried by ALL its outstanding VOTING shares, and the fair market value of ALL its
-- outstanding shares. Both the individual's shares and the whole are a `Block of shares`
-- (cbca-core.l4). The individual's shares are all the shares in which the individual has ANY of the
-- interests or rights in s 2.1(1)(a), each share counted ONCE (a share the individual both holds on
-- the register and owns beneficially is one share). That union is the "combination" the Act speaks of.
--
-- JUDGEMENTS AND REGULATIONS. "any direct or indirect influence that, if exercised, would result in
-- control in fact" (s 2.1(1)(b)) is a plain BOOLEAN input. "prescribed circumstances" (s 2.1(1)(c)) are
-- for the regulations, which are not among the sources: also a plain BOOLEAN input.

§ `Section 2.1 -- Individual with significant control`

§§ `s 2.1(3) significant number of shares`

-- (a) carry 25% or more of the voting rights attached to all the outstanding voting shares: "25% or more"
-- includes exactly 25%. Written without division. With no voting shares outstanding there is no
-- voting right to carry, so (a) is not met (the second conjunct; fork F6 in NOTES.md).
-- src:112 | (a) any number of shares that carry 25% or more of the voting rights attached to all of the corporation’s outstanding voting shares; or
@ref CBCA s 2.1(3)(a) significant number of shares (src:112)
GIVEN shares IS A `Block of shares`
      `the corporation's outstanding shares` IS A `Block of shares`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)(a)` shares `the corporation's outstanding shares` MEANS
        `the corporation's outstanding shares`'s `votes carried` GREATER THAN 0
    AND shares's `votes carried` AT LEAST 25% TIMES (`the corporation's outstanding shares`'s `votes carried`)

-- (b) equal to 25% or more of all the outstanding shares measured by fair market value.
-- src:113 | (b) any number of shares that is equal to 25% or more of all of the corporation’s outstanding shares measured by fair market value.
@ref CBCA s 2.1(3)(b) significant number of shares (src:113)
GIVEN shares IS A `Block of shares`
      `the corporation's outstanding shares` IS A `Block of shares`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)(b)` shares `the corporation's outstanding shares` MEANS
        `the corporation's outstanding shares`'s `fair market value in dollars` GREATER THAN 0
    AND shares's `fair market value in dollars` AT LEAST 25% TIMES (`the corporation's outstanding shares`'s `fair market value in dollars`)

-- src:111 | (3) For the purposes of this section, a significant number of shares of a corporation is
-- src:112 | (a) any number of shares that carry 25% or more of the voting rights attached to all of the corporation’s outstanding voting shares; or
-- src:113 | (b) any number of shares that is equal to 25% or more of all of the corporation’s outstanding shares measured by fair market value.
@ref CBCA s 2.1(3) significant number of shares (src:111-113)
GIVEN shares IS A `Block of shares`
      `the corporation's outstanding shares` IS A `Block of shares`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)` shares `the corporation's outstanding shares` MEANS
        `significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)(a)` shares `the corporation's outstanding shares`
    OR  `significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)(b)` shares `the corporation's outstanding shares`

§§ `s 2.1(1) individual with significant control`

-- (a): the individual has any of the interests or rights (i) registered holder, (ii) beneficial owner,
-- (iii) direct or indirect control or direction, or any combination of them, in respect of a
-- significant number of shares. `shares` is the union described at the top of this module.
-- src:100 | (a) an individual who has any of the following interests or rights, or any combination of them, in respect of a significant number of shares of the corporation:
-- src:101 | (i) the individual is the registered holder of them,
-- src:102 | (ii) the individual is the beneficial owner of them, or
-- src:103 | (iii) the individual has direct or indirect control or direction over them;
@ref CBCA s 2.1(1)(a) individual with significant control (src:100-103)
GIVEN `the individual is the registered holder of some of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the individual is the beneficial owner of some of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the individual has direct or indirect control or direction over some of the shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      shares IS A `Block of shares`
      `the corporation's outstanding shares` IS A `Block of shares`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`individual with significant control within s 2.1(1)(a)` MEANS
        (    `the individual is the registered holder of some of the shares`
         OR  `the individual is the beneficial owner of some of the shares`
         OR  `the individual has direct or indirect control or direction over some of the shares`)
    AND `significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)` shares `the corporation's outstanding shares`

-- src:104 | (b) an individual who has any direct or indirect influence that, if exercised, would result in control in fact of the corporation; or
@ref CBCA s 2.1(1)(b) individual with significant control (src:104)
GIVEN `the individual has direct or indirect influence that, if exercised, would result in control in fact of the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`individual with significant control within s 2.1(1)(b)` MEANS
    `the individual has direct or indirect influence that, if exercised, would result in control in fact of the corporation`

-- src:105 | (c) an individual to whom prescribed circumstances apply.
@ref CBCA s 2.1(1)(c) individual with significant control (src:105)
GIVEN `prescribed circumstances apply to the individual` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`individual with significant control within s 2.1(1)(c)` MEANS
    `prescribed circumstances apply to the individual`

§§ `s 2.1(2) joint ownership or control`

-- Two or more individuals are EACH considered an individual with significant control if, in respect of
-- a significant number of shares, (a) an interest or right referred to in (1)(a) is held jointly by
-- them, or (b) a right referred to in (1)(a) is subject to an agreement or arrangement under which it
-- is to be exercised jointly or in concert by them. Each alternative is read with its own shares (fork
-- F7 in NOTES.md).
-- src:107 | (2) Two or more individuals are each considered to be an individual with significant control over a corporation if, in respect of a significant number of shares of the corporation,
-- src:108 | (a) an interest or right, or a combination of interests or rights, referred to in paragraph (1)(a) is held jointly by those individuals; or
-- src:109 | (b) a right, or combination of rights, referred to in paragraph (1)(a) is subject to any agreement or arrangement under which the right or rights are to be exercised jointly or in concert by those individuals.
@ref CBCA s 2.1(2) joint ownership or control (src:107-109)
GIVEN `the number of individuals concerned` IS A NUMBER
      `an interest or right is held jointly by those individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares in which it is held jointly` IS A `Block of shares`
      `a right is subject to an agreement or arrangement to be exercised jointly or in concert by those individuals` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares subject to that agreement or arrangement` IS A `Block of shares`
      `the corporation's outstanding shares` IS A `Block of shares`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`each individual with significant control within s 2.1(2)` MEANS
        `the number of individuals concerned` AT LEAST 2
    AND (    (    `an interest or right is held jointly by those individuals`
              AND `significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)` `the shares in which it is held jointly` `the corporation's outstanding shares`)
         OR  (    `a right is subject to an agreement or arrangement to be exercised jointly or in concert by those individuals`
              AND `significant number of shares within s 2.1(3)` `the shares subject to that agreement or arrangement` `the corporation's outstanding shares`))
